    <briefdescription>
<para>Kitty <ref refid="classGraphics" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">Graphics</ref> Protocol APC payload decoder. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_kitty_decoder" kindref="compound">terminal::KittyDecoder</ref></computeroutput> parses an APC G payload (everything after &apos;G&apos; in the <computeroutput>ESC _ <ref refid="lstate_8h_1a103db2de6edf3420c6c6c9a282562406" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">G</ref> [key=value,...] ; [base64 payload] ESC \\endiskip</computeroutput> sequence) and produces an RGBA8 pixel buffer in the same <computeroutput>DecodedImage</computeroutput> format used by <computeroutput>SixelDecoder</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>ITerm2Decoder</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Protocol summary</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">ESC<sp/>_<sp/><ref refid="lstate_8h_1a103db2de6edf3420c6c6c9a282562406" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">G</ref><sp/>key=value,...;base64payload<sp/>ESC<sp/>\</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> Key=value pairs (comma-separated, before <computeroutput>;</computeroutput>):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>a</computeroutput> — action: t=transmit only, T=transmit+display (DEFAULT), p=display by id, d=delete, q=query</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>f</computeroutput> — format: 24=RGB, 32=RGBA (DEFAULT), 100=PNG</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>t</computeroutput> — transmission medium: d=direct base64 (DEFAULT — only supported mode)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>s</computeroutput> — pixel width (for f=24/32)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>v</computeroutput> — pixel height (for f=24/32)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>i</computeroutput> — image ID (for a=p/a=d)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>m</computeroutput> — more data: 1=more chunks coming, 0=final chunk (DEFAULT)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>o</computeroutput> — compression: z=zlib compressed (applied before base64)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>q</computeroutput> — quiet: 1=suppress OK response, 2=suppress all responses</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_decoded_image" kindref="compound">terminal::DecodedImage</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_sixel_decoder" kindref="compound">terminal::SixelDecoder</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_i_term2_decoder" kindref="compound">terminal::ITerm2Decoder</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>terminal::Model::addImageNode() </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
